MID_MV12_01: <SH>
MID_MV12_01_m001: There should be a village around here somewhere.
MID_MV12_01_m013: *sigh*
MID_MV12_01_m002: Suit yourself.
MID_MV12_01_m014: Hm?
MID_MV12_01_m015: Hm?
MID_MV12_01_m003: You are one of the Flame Lords of Dagda...\nknown as Dietrich, the Ravishing Shadow?
MID_MV12_01_m004: From one bizarre encounter directly into another.
MID_MV12_01_m005: Seems the land of Dagda holds many wonders.
MID_MV12_01_m006: Look at their attire and equipment.
MID_MV12_01_m007: Could it be...
MID_MV12_01_m016: *surprise noise*
MID_MV12_01_m008: *jump exert*\n*thrust exert*
MID_MV12_01_m009: Wha—
MID_MV12_01_m010: *gasp*
MID_MV12_01_m011: You have stopped me. Many do not.
MID_MV12_01_m017: *react of leaping back*\n*react of launching forward*\n*exert of sword swing*
MID_MV12_01_m012: *surprise react*